  <p>오류 사항은 contact@thejaeu.com 으로 보내주시기 바랍니다</p>
</blockquote>

<h2 id="기본-사용">기본 사용</h2>
<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;random&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>

<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">random_device</span> <span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">mt19937</span> <span class="nf">generator</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">());</span>

<span class="k">auto</span> <span class="n">rNumber</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">generator</span><span class="p">();</span>

<span class="c1">// ...</span>
</code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">&lt;random&gt;</code> 헤더를 통해 random_device를 초기화 하고 mt19937(유사 난수 생성기)를 해당 random_device로 초기화 함</li>
  <li>mt19937에는 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">operator()</code>가 정의 되어있으며 호출만 하면 난수가 생성이 됨</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="random-number-distribution">random number distribution</h2>
<h3 id="정수-균등-분포-생성">정수 균등 분포 생성</h3>
<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;random&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>

<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">random_device</span> <span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">mt19937</span> <span class="nf">generator</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">());</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">uniform_int_distribution</span><span class="o">&lt;&gt;</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// inclusive 0 and 100</span>

<span class="k">for</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">auto</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">gen</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// 0부터 100까지 균등한 확률로 생성됨</span>
	
<span class="c1">// ...</span>

</code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">uniform_int_distribution</code>을 통해 균등 분포된 값을 생성할 수 있음</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="정수-정규-분포-생성">정수 정규 분포 생성</h3>
<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="err">```</span><span class="n">cpp</span>
<span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;random&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>

<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">random_device</span> <span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">mt19937</span> <span class="nf">generator</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">());</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">normal_distribution</span><span class="o">&lt;&gt;</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">50</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">10</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// mean 50, stddev 10</span>

<span class="k">for</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">auto</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">gen</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// 100 개의 난수가 평균 50이 나오도록 표준편차 10으로 생성됨</span>

<span class="c1">// ...</span>
</code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">normal_distribution</code>을 통해 정규 분포된 값을 생성할 수 있음</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="실수-균등-분포-생성">실수 균등 분포 생성</h3>
<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;random&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>

<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">random_device</span> <span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">mt19937</span> <span class="nf">generator</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">());</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">uniform_real_distribution</span><span class="o">&lt;&gt;</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// inclusive -100 and 100</span>

<span class="k">for</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">auto</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">gen</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// double 타입의 값을 return 함</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>
</code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">uniform_real_distribution</code>을 통해 균등 분포 된 실수 값을 생성할 수 있음</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="실수-정규-분포-생성">실수 정규 분포 생성</h3>
<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;random&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>

<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">random_device</span> <span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">mt19937</span> <span class="nf">generator</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">seed</span><span class="p">());</span>
<span class="n">std</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">normal_distribution</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="kt">double</span><span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">8</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// mean 0, stddev 8</span>

<span class="k">for</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">auto</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">dis</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">gen</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="c1">// double 타입의 값을 return 함</span>
<span class="c1">// ...</span>
</code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">normal_distribution</code>의 타입 명시를 통해 정규 분포된 실수 값을 생성할 수 있음</li>
</ul>]]></content><author><name>김재우(thejaeu)</name></author><category term="C++" /><category term="c++" /><category term="cpp" /><category term="random_device" /><category term="mt19937" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[오류 사항은 contact@thejaeu.com 으로 보내주시기 바랍니다]]></summary></entry></feed>